    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t01-mother-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t01-mother-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26广东）雨季期间，某市单日的暴雨发生率为30%，暴雨出现时当地市区主干道拥堵的概率为70%，其余时间拥堵的概率为20%，则雨季期间当地市区主干道拥堵的平均概率为（）。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "25%"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "35%"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "45%"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "55%"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          134
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          128
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s13-t01-mother-03-p134.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（二） · 母题精讲3 · 讲义第128页",
            "pdfPage": 134
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t01-mother-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s13-t01-mother-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们把一天分成暴雨与不暴雨两类，概率分别30%、70%。两类条件下的拥堵概率不同，不能直接取70%与20%的平均数。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "暴雨且拥堵的概率为0.3×0.7，非暴雨且拥堵为0.7×0.2。两类互斥，结果相加为0.35。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "P(\\text{拥堵})=0.3\\times0.7+0.7\\times0.2=0.35"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以我们选B。这里用的是按天气分类的全概率，并不是说暴雨和拥堵相互独立。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
