    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t01-practice-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "思维精练 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t01-practice-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26广东事考）在一场射击训练中，甲、乙、丙三人击中目标的概率分别为1/2、2/3和3/4。如果三人向同一个目标射击，则目标至少被其中一人击中的概率是：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "3/4"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "5/6"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "11/12"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "23/24"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          135
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          129
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s13-t01-practice-03-p135.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（二） · 思维精练3 · 讲义第129页",
            "pdfPage": 135
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s13-t01-practice-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s13-t01-practice-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们看到“至少一人击中”，先算三人全都没中。按各人射击相互独立的模型，三人未中的概率分别是1/2、1/3、1/4。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "三人全未中概率1/24，反过来至少一人命中就是23/24。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "P=1-\\left(1-\\frac12\\right)\\left(1-\\frac23\\right)\\left(1-\\frac34\\right)=\\frac{23}{24}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以我们选D。至少一人不是恰好一人，不能只加三种单独命中的情况。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
